"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Omejitve hitrosti, število povezav na torrent, čas nalaganja in sejanje so nastavljeni za vsak torrent, ko ga dodate, ali kasneje v Nastavitvah torrenta. Torrents uporabljajo proxy iz zavihka Povezava (HTTP ali SOCKS5, ali Macov proxy z \"Uporabi sistemske nastavitve\") in omejitev hitrosti za vse prenose. Spremembe veljajo za torrente, ki se začnejo kasneje. Peers in sledilci lahko vidijo vaš IP naslov, ali vaš proxy.";
